WEBVTT

00:13:27.333 --> 00:13:30.667
apart from another dying human?

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.809
All you have to do is overcome your fear,

00:13:34.833 --> 00:13:38.042
using the tools that you already
have in your hands.

00:13:38.917 --> 00:13:40.643
Like your phones.

00:13:40.667 --> 00:13:45.226
So on the day that you hear
that someone has lost someone they love,

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.601
you don't wait

00:13:46.625 --> 00:13:49.184
but you reach out then with that phone

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:53.893
and call them up and say,
"I'm sorry for your loss."

00:13:53.917 --> 00:13:56.476
Or go visit the sick and dying

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.101
and try to be there
for the moment of death,

00:13:59.125 --> 00:14:01.934
for the witness and the wonder.